# Deliberately tracked: package-lock.json is the reproducible dependency lockfile.
# Deliberately tracked: testdata fixtures, manifest, public keys, and helper scripts are test inputs.
# Deliberately tracked: docs/, AGENTS.md, and .github/copilot-instructions.md document project rules.
# Deliberately tracked: config/uidai_spki.pem is a public key, not a secret.
